{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-24131","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27590","text":"03 — Invocation Gateway"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27591","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-27592","text":" How agent invocations flow through the Edge Function gateway, including the canonical request/response shapes, authentication, limit checks, session handling, streaming, and error normalization."}]}],"id":"blk-24132","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-24134","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27593","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24135","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27594","text":"Gateway Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-24136","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27595","text":"The invocation gateway is a Supabase Edge Function at "},{"id":"spn-27596","marks":["code"],"text":"/functions/v1/invoke/:agentId"},{"id":"spn-27597","text":". It authenticates the caller, checks plan limits, resolves the active deployment, routes to the runtime provider adapter, and returns a normalized response."}]},{"id":"blk-24137","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27598","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24138","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27599","text":"Request Shape ("},{"id":"spn-27600","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeRequest"},{"id":"spn-27601","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-24139","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeRequest {\n  input: {\n    messages?: Array<{\n      role: \"system\" | \"user\" | \"assistant\" | \"tool\";\n      content: string;\n    }>;\n    prompt?: string;  // converted to messages if provided\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;  // opaque; provider-specific\n  options?: {\n    maxSteps?: number;\n    temperature?: number;\n    toolPolicy?: { allow?: string[]; deny?: string[] };\n  };\n  metadata?: {\n    traceId?: string;\n    client?: string;\n  };\n}"},{"id":"blk-24140","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27602","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-27603","text":" If "},{"id":"spn-27604","marks":["code"],"text":"prompt"},{"id":"spn-27605","text":" is provided instead of "},{"id":"spn-27606","marks":["code"],"text":"messages"},{"id":"spn-27607","text":", the gateway converts it to "},{"id":"spn-27608","marks":["code"],"text":"[{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }]"},{"id":"spn-27609","text":" before forwarding."}]},{"id":"blk-24141","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27610","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24142","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27611","text":"Response Shape ("},{"id":"spn-27612","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeResponse"},{"id":"spn-27613","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-24143","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeResponse {\n  output: {\n    text: string;\n    messages?: Array<{ role: string; content: string }>;\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;\n  usage: {\n    tokens?: number;\n    computeMs?: number;\n    toolCalls?: number;\n  };\n  traceId: string;\n  error?: NormalizedError;\n}"},{"id":"blk-24144","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27614","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24145","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27615","text":"Gateway Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-24146","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Parse request\n2. Authenticate (Supabase Auth JWT)\n3. Load agent record (RLS-filtered)\n4. Verify agent.status === \"active\"\n5. Resolve active deployment + runtime provider\n6. Check plan limits (billing_usage vs tier limits)\n7. Generate traceId (if not provided)\n8. Route to RPI adapter: invoke(input, sessionId, options)\n9. Normalize response\n10. Return to caller"},{"id":"blk-24147","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27616","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24148","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27617","text":"Authentication"}]},{"id":"blk-24149","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27618","text":"All invocations require a valid Supabase Auth JWT in the "},{"id":"spn-27619","marks":["code"],"text":"Authorization"},{"id":"spn-27620","text":" header:"}]},{"id":"blk-24150","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Authorization: Bearer <supabase-jwt>"},{"id":"blk-24151","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27621","text":"The gateway extracts "},{"id":"spn-27622","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid()"},{"id":"spn-27623","text":" and uses it to load the agent via RLS. If the agent does not belong to the caller, the query returns empty and the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-27624","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"},{"id":"spn-27625","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-24152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27626","text":"Post-MVP: per-agent API keys for public invocation."}]},{"id":"blk-24153","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27627","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24154","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27628","text":"Limit Checks"}]},{"id":"blk-24155","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27629","text":"Before routing to the provider, the gateway checks:"}]},{"id":"blk-24156","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"SELECT total_requests, total_tokens, total_compute_ms\nFROM billing_usage\nWHERE user_id = auth.uid()\n  AND period_key = current_period();"},{"id":"blk-24157","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27630","text":"If any metric exceeds the user's tier limit, the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-27631","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"},{"id":"spn-27632","text":" without invoking the agent."}]},{"id":"blk-24158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27633","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24159","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27634","text":"Session Handling"}]},{"id":"blk-24160","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27635","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-27636","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-27637","text":" is provided, it is forwarded to the provider as-is."}]}],"id":"blk-24161","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24164","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27638","text":"If absent, the provider may create a new session and return the "},{"id":"spn-27639","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-27640","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-24163","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24166","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27641","text":"The gateway treats "},{"id":"spn-27642","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-27643","text":" as "},{"id":"spn-27644","marks":["bold"],"text":"opaque"},{"id":"spn-27645","text":" -- never parses or validates it."}]}],"id":"blk-24165","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27646","text":"Session semantics are provider-specific (DO instance for Cloudflare, runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-24167","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-24169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27647","text":"session for AgentCore)."}]},{"id":"blk-24170","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27648","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24171","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27649","text":"Streaming"}]},{"id":"blk-24172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27650","text":"When the provider supports streaming, the gateway uses Server-Sent Events (SSE):"}]},{"id":"blk-24173","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Content-Type: text/event-stream\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\"Hello\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\" world\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"done\",\"usage\":{\"tokens\":12,\"computeMs\":340}}"},{"id":"blk-24174","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27651","text":"When a provider does not support true streaming, the gateway MAY emulate it by returning the full response as a single chunk followed by "},{"id":"spn-27652","marks":["code"],"text":"done"},{"id":"spn-27653","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-24175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27654","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24176","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27655","text":"Error Normalization"}]},{"id":"blk-24177","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27656","text":"All errors are mapped to a standard code set:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-24179","spans":[{"id":"spn-27657","text":"Code"}]},{"id":"blk-24180","spans":[{"id":"spn-27658","text":"HTTP Status"}]},{"id":"blk-24181","spans":[{"id":"spn-27659","text":"Meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-24178","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-24182","spans":[{"id":"spn-27660","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHENTICATED"}]},{"id":"blk-24183","spans":[{"id":"spn-27661","text":"401"}]},{"id":"blk-24184","spans":[{"id":"spn-27662","text":"Missing or invalid JWT"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24185","spans":[{"id":"spn-27663","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHORIZED"}]},{"id":"blk-24186","spans":[{"id":"spn-27664","text":"403"}]},{"id":"blk-24187","spans":[{"id":"spn-27665","text":"Valid JWT but no access to this agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24188","spans":[{"id":"spn-27666","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"}]},{"id":"blk-24189","spans":[{"id":"spn-27667","text":"404"}]},{"id":"blk-24190","spans":[{"id":"spn-27668","text":"Agent does not exist (or not owned by caller)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24191","spans":[{"id":"spn-27669","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"}]},{"id":"blk-24192","spans":[{"id":"spn-27670","text":"429"}]},{"id":"blk-24193","spans":[{"id":"spn-27671","text":"Plan limit reached for this period"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24194","spans":[{"id":"spn-27672","marks":["code"],"text":"DEPLOYMENT_FAILED"}]},{"id":"blk-24195","spans":[{"id":"spn-27673","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-24196","spans":[{"id":"spn-27674","text":"No active deployment or deployment is broken"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24197","spans":[{"id":"spn-27675","marks":["code"],"text":"RUNTIME_ERROR"}]},{"id":"blk-24198","spans":[{"id":"spn-27676","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-24199","spans":[{"id":"spn-27677","text":"Provider returned an error during execution"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24200","spans":[{"id":"spn-27678","marks":["code"],"text":"INVALID_REQUEST"}]},{"id":"blk-24201","spans":[{"id":"spn-27679","text":"400"}]},{"id":"blk-24202","spans":[{"id":"spn-27680","text":"Malformed input or missing required fields"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-24203","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"LIMIT_EXCEEDED\",\n    \"message\": \"Monthly request limit reached. Upgrade your plan.\",\n    \"traceId\": \"tr_abc123\"\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-24204","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27681","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-27682","text":" Error messages must be safe for display. Never include secrets or internal stack traces."}]},{"id":"blk-24205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27683","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24206","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27684","text":"Rate Limiting"}]},{"id":"blk-24207","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27685","text":"The gateway SHOULD enforce per-user and per-agent rate limits beyond plan quotas:"}]},{"id":"blk-24208","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24210","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27686","text":"Per-user: max N requests/second across all agents"}]}],"id":"blk-24209","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24212","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27687","text":"Per-agent: max M requests/second per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-24211","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27688","text":"Payload size: max 1 MB request body"}]}],"id":"blk-24213","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-24215","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27689","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24216","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-27690","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-24217","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24219","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27691","text":"[ ] Every invocation is authenticated via Supabase Auth JWT"}]}],"id":"blk-24218","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24221","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27692","text":"[ ] Agent status is verified as "},{"id":"spn-27693","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-27694","text":" before routing"}]}],"id":"blk-24220","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27695","text":"[ ] Plan limits are checked before invoking the provider"}]}],"id":"blk-24222","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24225","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27696","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-27697","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-27698","text":" is generated or forwarded on every request"}]}],"id":"blk-24224","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24227","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27699","text":"[ ] Errors are normalized to the standard code set"}]}],"id":"blk-24226","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24229","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27700","text":"[ ] Error messages never contain secrets or internal details"}]}],"id":"blk-24228","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24231","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27701","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-27702","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-27703","text":" is treated as opaque"}]}],"id":"blk-24230","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24233","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27704","text":"[ ] Streaming uses SSE format when supported"}]}],"id":"blk-24232","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24235","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-27705","text":"[ ] Request payload size is validated"}]}],"id":"blk-24234","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierath2ykvdyofad76qpc5enhvee64aq2wbprkiv46lp5zilpu6z4wta","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}